# The build context is the repository root. Exclude only what the image does not need.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/*/dist
packages/*/dist
contracts/out
contracts/cache
contracts/lib

# Local secrets are not put into the image. compose mounts them at runtime.
deploy/local-secrets

# design-system/dist is **not excluded.** It is a committed artifact and the exports of
# `@mpc/design` point to it; excluding it leaves the web build unable to find the CSS.
